From its second run on, cigo's 20,664-line script starts in {{median.orchestrate.cig-vm}} ms on the VM where the tree-walker takes {{median.orchestrate.cig-tree}}. The first run of a script pays for the lowering: {{median.lines-500.cig-vm-cold}} ms against {{median.lines-500.cig-tree}} for a 500-line script ([measured here](docs/ENGINES-FIRST-RUNS-1.25.0.md)), which is why the tree-walker is still the default.
